---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
    title="Terms of Service | Junaid Babu" 
    description="Terms of service and usage conditions for Junaid Babu's web applications and open-source software."
    showAds={false}
>
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 py-16 w-full">
        <h1 class="font-sans text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-8">Terms of Service</h1>
        <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none text-slate-600">
            <h2 class="font-sans text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-4">1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
            <p class="mb-4">By accessing and using applications hosted on junaidbabu.github.io (such as Phonics Buddy, Tic-Tac-Vibe, etc.), you agree to adhere completely to these Terms of Service.</p>
            
            <h2 class="font-sans text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-4">2. Application Usage</h2>
            <p class="mb-4">The tools provided are built mostly as open-source experimental software and educational proofs-of-concept. They are provided "AS IS" without warranties of any kind regarding extended uptime or reliability.</p>

            <h2 class="font-sans text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-4">3. Intellectual Property</h2>
            <p class="mb-4">Application code hosted on my GitHub domain remains my property unless expressly released under an open-source license locally within its repository. You may not re-upload, re-monetize, or clone these apps for commercial benefit without explicit prior consent.</p>

            <h2 class="font-sans text-2xl font-bold text-slate-900 mt-8 mb-4">4. Amendments</h2>
            <p>These terms reserve the right to be modified at any specific juncture. Continued use implies consent.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</Layout>
